            "content": "<p><strong>Capacity<br/></strong>It can comfortably store up to 36 cans</p><p><strong>Dimensions<br/></strong>Cooler Open: 12.5\"H x 4.5\"W x 15\"L<br/>Stuff Sack: 9\"H x 3\"W x 10\"L<br/>24 liter capacity<br/><br/><strong>Materials</strong><br/>Ripstop Nylon<br/>Hydrophobic Synthetic Insulation<br/>Waterproof YKK Zippers<br/><br/><br/>Use the roll-top for peak performance and comfort. We also find the product performs best with ice packs rather than ice in higher humidity environments if you are concerned about condensation. <br/></p>",
